    ["\n　　今日，为女神带去了两束薄荷深眠花束。\n\n　　女神庇佑，只要能通过政府雇员考试，让考官爱上我我也愿意！\n\n　　……\n\n　　……\n\n　　失败了……\n\n　　努力出摊，售卖猪腿，争取为女神带去一整个深眠花园。"] = "\n　　Today, I brought two bouquets of mint and deep sleep flowers to the Goddess.\n\n　　May the Goddess bless, as long as I can pass the government employee exam, I am willing to let the examiner fall in love with me!\n\n　　……\n\n　　……\n\n　　Failed……\n\n　　Strive to set up a stall, sell pork legs, and strive to bring a whole deep sleep garden to the Goddess.",
