    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>战场背景</>\n<Highlight>末日将近</>，星空中的污染日益逼近，<Highlight>非凡事件</>频发。各大非凡俱乐部自发组织联合演练，在历史沙盘中模拟对抗，以应对即将到来的危机。<Highlight>四方联赛</>，便是其中规模最大、最接近实战的训练场。<Highlight>俱乐部</>同场竞技，争夺的不仅是荣誉，更是锤炼<Highlight>末日来临</>时守护人类的能力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battlefield Background </>\n <Highlight> The apocalypse is near </>, corruption from the starry sky is closing in, and <Highlight> Beyonder incidents </> are frequent. Major Beyonder clubs have spontaneously organized joint drills, simulating confrontations in historical sandboxes to prepare for the coming crisis. The <Highlight> Four-Way League </> is the largest and most realistic training ground among them. <Highlight> Clubs </> compete in the same arena, vying not just for honor, but to hone the ability to <Highlight> protect humanity when the apocalypse arrives </>.",
