    ["学生镜头"] = "Student Camera",
    ["安西娅的第四个玩偶，名叫巴尼先生。母亲在红月下入梦，为她祛除病痛，给她新生。醒来时，崭新的巴尼先生就在她怀里。它很厉害，陪着她，还把妈妈们变成了漂亮的蝴蝶。母亲指引她前往种满苹果树的庄园，那里有温柔的子爵夫人和生病的小子爵。女孩不想再失去朋友。她最清楚——吃下妈妈的苹果，朋友就不会再痛了。\n“安西娅……好孩子……”"] = "Anthea's fourth doll, named Mr. Barney. Her mother entered her dream under the crimson moon, removing her illness and giving her a new life. When she woke up, a brand-new Mr. Barney was in her arms. It is very powerful, accompanying her and turning the mothers into beautiful butterflies. Her mother guided her to the manor filled with apple trees, where the gentle Viscountess and the sick young Viscount lived. The girl did not want to lose any more friends. She knows best—if you eat mother's apple, your friend will no longer be in pain. \n \"Anthea... good child...\"",
