    ["我还需要再考虑一下构图。"] = "I still need to think about the composition.",
    ["战区筛选积分仅在<Highlight>战区筛选期间</>的四方联赛中获取。只有<Highlight>神话组</>的俱乐部可获得战略服筛选积分。筛选期间，俱乐部参与四方联赛并累计积分；筛选结束后，将按本赛区累计积分排名，<Highlight>前4名俱乐部晋级战略服</>。\n四方联赛每场第一、二名进入胜者组，第三、四名进入败者组；第二场结束后，按比赛结果确定本轮第1至第8名。\n战区筛选积分由<Highlight>单场名次积分</>与<Highlight>每轮最终排名积分</>累计组成：\n<Highlight>单场名次积分：</>第1名30分，第2名15分，第3名10分，第4名5分。\n<Highlight>第一轮最终排名积分：</>第1名60分，第2名50分，第3名45分，第4名40分，第5至第8名各10分。\n<Highlight>第二轮最终排名积分：</>第1名200分，第2名100分，第3名70分，第4名50分，第5至第8名各15分。\n<Highlight>同分排序规则：</>战区筛选排名优先按照<Highlight>战区筛选总积分</>由高到低排列。总积分相同时：第一轮或第二轮联赛结束后，按照俱乐部在本轮的<Highlight>最终排名</>排序，排名靠前者优先；四方联赛每轮第一场比赛结束后，本轮尚未产生最终排名，同分俱乐部暂不区分排名先后，当前展示顺序不代表本轮最终排名。\n<Highlight>额外神选席位：</>战略服结算时，筛选时的赛区前三名俱乐部可额外获得神选席位：<Highlight>第1名10个，第2名5个，第3名5个</>。"] = "Warzone screening points are only obtained during the Four-Way League in the <Highlight> Warzone Screening Period </>. Only Clubs in the <Highlight> Mythical Group </> can earn Strategic Server screening points. During the screening period, Clubs participate in the Four-Way League and accumulate points; after the screening ends, rankings will be based on the cumulative points in this warzone, with the <Highlight> top 4 Clubs advancing to the Strategic Server </>. \n In each match of the Four-Way League, the first and second place teams enter the Winners' Bracket, while the third and fourth place teams enter the Losers' Bracket; after the second match, the 1st to 8th place for this round are determined based on the match results. \n Warzone screening points are composed of the cumulative <Highlight> Single-Match Placement Points </> and <Highlight> Final Round Ranking Points </>: \n <Highlight> Single-Match Placement Points: </> 1st place: 30 points, 2nd place: 15 points, 3rd place: 10 points, 4th place: 5 points. \n <Highlight> First Round Final Ranking Points: </> 1st place: 60 points, 2nd place: 50 points, 3rd place: 45 points, 4th place: 40 points, 5th to 8th place: 10 points each. \n <Highlight> Second Round Final Ranking Points: </> 1st place: 200 points, 2nd place: 100 points, 3rd place: 70 points, 4th place: 50 points, 5th to 8th place: 15 points each. \n <Highlight> Tie-breaking Rules: </> Warzone screening rankings are prioritized by <Highlight> Total Warzone Screening Points </> from highest to lowest. When total points are equal: after the first or second round of the league ends, the ranking is based on the Club's <Highlight> Final Ranking </> in that round, with the higher rank taking priority; after the first match of each Four-Way League round, the final ranking for the round has not yet been determined, so tied Clubs are not distinguished by rank, and the current display order does not represent the final ranking for the round. \n <Highlight> Additional God-Chosen Seats: </> When the Strategic Server settles, the top three Clubs in the warzone during screening can receive additional God-Chosen Seats: <Highlight> 1st place: 10 seats, 2nd place: 5 seats, 3rd place: 5 seats </>.",
    ["所以你们按照书里的偏方，用火为菲丽丝驱邪？"] = "So you followed the folk remedies in the book and used fire to exorcise evil from Phyllis?",
    ["打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>55装等</>的金色和紫色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。\n\n<Highlight>转化上限</>：最多转化为<Highlight>10</>个秘宝，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。"] = "Open to randomly receive one piece of gold or purple quality Equipment with <Highlight>Item Level 55</>, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged in the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable items of the corresponding Item Level</>, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc. \n\n<Highlight>Conversion Limit</>: Can be converted into a maximum of <Highlight>10</> Treasures; if the progress is exceeded, it will be <Highlight>automatically stored</>, and after the new Item Level Treasures are unlocked, they will be <Highlight>converted into new Treasures</>.",
