    ["现在她总说托马斯还在，就在她旁边坐着。有时还给空座位倒酒，说托马斯爱喝这口……"] = "Now she always says Thomas is still here, sitting right next to her. Sometimes she even pours a drink for the empty seat, saying Thomas loves this stuff...",
