    ["眉尾"] = "Outer Brow",
    ["真的吗！但我听说，这里的待遇非常好？"] = "Really! But I heard that the treatment here is very good?",
    ["竞拍出价不足。"] = "Auction bid insufficient.",
    ["等级达到40级且完成前一分页所有推荐任务后开启"] = "Unlocks upon reaching level 40 and completing all recommended quests on the previous page",
    ["结社之辉说明"] = "Radiance of the Organization Instructions",
    ["罗塞尔赛季"] = "Roselle Season",
    ["老尼尔，黑荆棘资历最深的老前辈之一。他会教你冥想、灵视，还会教你在报销单上如何“合理”填数字。他欠账三十镑时，也能对捡来的三百镑钱包分文不动。\n“为所欲为，但勿伤害”，是他恪守一生的格言。\n他曾是正式值夜者，但离晋升始终差了那么一步。年纪渐长，教会让他转做“看守者”或回家休养，他拒绝了。他只愿留在黑荆棘，守着那些泛黄的典籍，为大家点亮一盏灯。\n在平常幽默风趣的相处中，没人知道，老尼尔一直在节省资金，试图用禁忌的“生命炼成”仪式复活亡妻。他在需要鲜血材料的配方旁写道：“可以考虑抽取我的。”——他宁愿用自己的血，也不愿伤害任何人。\n直到隐匿贤者的低语吞没他，队友亲手送别他……当值夜者们翻开老尼尔的日记，看见最后一页写着：“如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。”时，他们终于明白了老尼尔最后的坚守。\n他想用余生为年轻人照亮一小段路，然后用生命，践行一句无人知晓的誓言。"] = "Old Neil, one of the most senior veterans of Blackthorn. He would teach you meditation and spirit vision, and he would also teach you how to \"reasonably\" fill in numbers on expense reports. When he owed thirty pounds, he could also leave a three-hundred-pound wallet he found untouched. \n \"Do what you will, but do no harm\" was the motto he upheld his whole life. \n He was once an official Nighthawk, but he was always one step away from promotion. As he grew older, the Church asked him to become a \"Gatekeeper\" or retire at home, but he refused. He only wished to stay at Blackthorn, guarding those yellowed classics and lighting a lamp for everyone. \n In their usual humorous interactions, no one knew that Old Neil had been saving money, trying to resurrect his late wife with the forbidden \"Life Creation\" ritual. Next to the formula that required blood materials, he wrote: \"Can consider extracting mine.\"—He would rather use his own blood than hurt anyone. \n Until the whispers of the Hidden Sage engulfed him, and his teammates sent him off with their own hands... When the Nighthawks opened Old Neil's diary and saw the last page written: \"If I cannot save her, then I will accompany her,\" they finally understood Old Neil's final persistence. \n He wanted to illuminate a short path for the young people with the rest of his life, and then use his life to practice a vow that no one knew.",
    ["职位设定"] = "Position Settings",
